    basis:
      'Page 13, Corollaire 3 (ii), states this with « réduit » underlined and « et un seul »; the leaf stops on the statement, without proof. Corollaire 3 (i), on the same page, is not part of this claim: with S only reduced (« normal » struck) its sufficiency is false, and the reading, after its second-pass revision, states it for S normal, with a counterexample on a nodal cubic base.',
