      'J. Voight, Discriminants and the monoid of quadratic rings, Pacific J. Math. 283 (2016), arXiv:1504.05228v3. It defines the product of quadratic rings over an arbitrary base, with multiplicative discriminant. A full-text search finds no mention of quaternion rings, so the paper does not link the product to a degenerate locus of quaternion structures.',
      'J. Voight, Quaternion Algebras, GTM 288 (2021), open version jvoight.github.io/quat-book.pdf dated 2026-08-05, searched by keyword only (« two quadratic », « pair of quadratic », « quadratic subalgebras », « two embeddings », « simultaneous », « product of quadratic »): no statement on orders containing two given quadratic orders. § 30.8.3 counts optimal embeddings of one quadratic order at a time. Chapters 22 and 30 were not read through.',
